{"seq":1,"slug":"knowledge-representation-ai","title":"知识表示与 AI 应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/applications/knowledge-representation-ai","wordCount":1264,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"知识表示与-ai-应用\">知识表示与 AI 应用</h1><p>Prolog 从诞生之初就与人工智能密不可分——它的设计目标就是将一阶逻辑推理直接可计算化。在专家系统、语义网、自然语言理解和规则引擎领域，Prolog 的声明式知识表示能力至今无可替代。随着 LLM 时代符号推理作为神经网络互补手段重新获得关注，Prolog 在「可解释 AI」和「神经符号融合」中正迎来新的应用场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把知识编码成 Prolog 程序，围绕以下概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>知识表示模式</strong>：事实集合、IS-A 层次、框架、语义网三元组、本体，从扁平到结构化、从轻到重各有取舍；</li>\n<li><strong>推理即执行</strong>：规则库用 Prolog 子句书写，SLD 归结就是推理引擎，无需另写推理机；</li>\n<li><strong>可解释性</strong>：借助元解释器逐步追踪推理链，得到完整决策解释，这是相对黑盒 ML 的核心优势；</li>\n<li><strong>规则引擎</strong>：业务规则以声明式子句维护，与应用代码解耦，便于独立审阅与修改；</li>\n<li><strong>神经符号融合</strong>：LLM 负责把自然语言转为符号查询，Prolog 充当验证层与可证明的执行引擎。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示方法</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事实集合</td>\n<td>简单直接</td>\n<td>无结构</td>\n<td>扁平数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IS-A 层次</td>\n<td>支持继承</td>\n<td>单继承</td>\n<td>分类系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架</td>\n<td>结构化属性</td>\n<td>较重</td>\n<td>对象描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义网三元组</td>\n<td>标准化、可链接</td>\n<td>查询复杂</td>\n<td>开放领域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本体</td>\n<td>形式推理</td>\n<td>计算开销</td>\n<td>形式验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"知识表示的基本模式\">知识表示的基本模式</h2><h3 id=\"分类层次与继承\">分类层次与继承</h3><p>Prolog 的项结构和规则机制天然适合表达 IS-A 层次和属性继承：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 分类层次&#10;is_a(canary, bird).&#10;is_a(penguin, bird).&#10;is_a(bird, animal).&#10;is_a(animal, living_thing).&#10;&#10;%% 属性与继承&#10;has_property(bird, can_fly).&#10;has_property(bird, has_feathers).&#10;has_property(penguin, cannot_fly).  % 例外覆盖&#10;&#10;%% 带例外的属性推理&#10;property(X, P) :-&#10;    has_property(X, P).&#10;property(X, P) :-&#10;    is_a(X, Parent),&#10;    property(Parent, P),&#10;    \\+ has_property(X, overrides(P)).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 分类层次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>is_a(canary, bird).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>is_a(penguin, bird).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>is_a(bird, animal).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>is_a(animal, living_thing).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 属性与继承</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>has_property(bird, can_fly).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>has_property(bird, has_feathers).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>has_property(penguin, cannot_fly).  % 例外覆盖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 带例外的属性推理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>property(X, P) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    has_property(X, P).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>property(X, P) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is_a(X, Parent),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    property(Parent, P),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \\+ has_property(X, overrides(P)).</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"框架表示\">框架表示</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 框架风格的知识表示&#10;frame(elephant, [&#10;    is_a - mammal,&#10;    color - grey,&#10;    size - large,&#10;    has_trunk - true,&#10;    diet - herbivore&#10;]).&#10;&#10;%% 查询框架属性&#10;slot_value(Entity, Slot, Value) :-&#10;    frame(Entity, Slots),&#10;    member(Slot - Value, Slots).&#10;slot_value(Entity, Slot, Value) :-&#10;    frame(Entity, Slots),&#10;    member(is_a - Parent, Slots),&#10;    slot_value(Parent, Slot, Value).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 框架风格的知识表示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>frame(elephant, [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    is_a - mammal,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    color - grey,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    size - large,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    has_trunk - true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    diet - herbivore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 查询框架属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>slot_value(Entity, Slot, Value) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    frame(Entity, Slots),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    member(Slot - Value, Slots).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>slot_value(Entity, Slot, Value) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    frame(Entity, Slots),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    member(is_a - Parent, Slots),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    slot_value(Parent, Slot, Value).</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示方法</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事实集合</td>\n<td>简单直接</td>\n<td>无结构</td>\n<td>扁平数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IS-A 层次</td>\n<td>支持继承</td>\n<td>单继承</td>\n<td>分类系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架</td>\n<td>结构化属性</td>\n<td>较重</td>\n<td>对象描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义网（三元组）</td>\n<td>标准化、可链接</td>\n<td>查询复杂</td>\n<td>开放领域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本体（OWL 风格）</td>\n<td>形式推理</td>\n<td>计算开销</td>\n<td>形式验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"专家系统\">专家系统</h2><p>Prolog 是构建专家系统的经典工具——规则库直接用 Prolog 子句表达，推理引擎就是 Prolog 运行时本身：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 医疗诊断专家系统骨架&#10;:- dynamic symptom/2.&#10;&#10;diagnose(Patient, flu) :-&#10;    symptom(Patient, fever),&#10;    symptom(Patient, body_ache),&#10;    symptom(Patient, fatigue).&#10;diagnose(Patient, cold) :-&#10;    symptom(Patient, sneezing),&#10;    symptom(Patient, runny_nose),&#10;    \\+ symptom(Patient, fever).&#10;diagnose(Patient, allergy) :-&#10;    symptom(Patient, sneezing),&#10;    symptom(Patient, itchy_eyes),&#10;    \\+ symptom(Patient, fever).&#10;&#10;%% 解释推理过程&#10;explain_diagnosis(Patient, Disease, Reasons) :-&#10;    diagnose(Patient, Disease),&#10;    findall(S, symptom(Patient, S), Reasons).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 医疗诊断专家系统骨架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- dynamic symptom/2.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>diagnose(Patient, flu) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    symptom(Patient, fever),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    symptom(Patient, body_ache),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    symptom(Patient, fatigue).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>diagnose(Patient, cold) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    symptom(Patient, sneezing),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    symptom(Patient, runny_nose),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \\+ symptom(Patient, fever).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>diagnose(Patient, allergy) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    symptom(Patient, sneezing),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    symptom(Patient, itchy_eyes),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \\+ symptom(Patient, fever).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 解释推理过程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>explain_diagnosis(Patient, Disease, Reasons) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    diagnose(Patient, Disease),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    findall(S, symptom(Patient, S), Reasons).</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;用户输入症状&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;知识库&lt;br/&gt;(规则 + 事实)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;推理引擎&lt;br/&gt;(SLD 归结)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{&quot;匹配成功?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| E[&quot;输出诊断 + 解释&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| F[&quot;请求更多信息&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; A&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;置信度评估&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"用户输入症状\"] --&gt; B[\"知识库&lt;br/&gt;(规则 + 事实)\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"推理引擎&lt;br/&gt;(SLD 归结)\"]\n    C --&gt; D{\"匹配成功?\"}\n    D --&gt;|\"是\"| E[\"输出诊断 + 解释\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"否\"| F[\"请求更多信息\"]\n    F --&gt; A\n    E --&gt; G[\"置信度评估\"]</pre><h3 id=\"可解释性优势\">可解释性优势</h3><p>与黑盒 ML 模型不同，Prolog 专家系统可以通过<a href=\"../advanced-topics/meta-programming-reflection\">元编程与反射</a>中介绍的元解释器精确追踪每一步推理，提供完整的决策解释链：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 带解释的推理&#10;:- meta_predicate explain(0, -).&#10;explain(Goal, Explanation) :-&#10;    explain(Goal, [], Explanation).&#10;&#10;explain(true, Trail, Trail) :- !.&#10;explain((A, B), Trail0, Trail) :- !,&#10;    explain(A, Trail0, Trail1),&#10;    explain(B, Trail1, Trail).&#10;explain(Goal, Trail0, Trail) :-&#10;    clause(Goal, Body),&#10;    explain(Body, [used(Goal)|Trail0], Trail).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 带解释的推理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- meta_predicate explain(0, -).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>explain(Goal, Explanation) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    explain(Goal, [], Explanation).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>explain(true, Trail, Trail) :- !.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>explain((A, B), Trail0, Trail) :- !,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    explain(A, Trail0, Trail1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    explain(B, Trail1, Trail).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>explain(Goal, Trail0, Trail) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    clause(Goal, Body),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    explain(Body, [used(Goal)|Trail0], Trail).</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"语义网与本体推理\">语义网与本体推理</h2><p>Prolog 是实现 RDF/OWL 推理器的自然选择——三元组直接映射为 Prolog 事实，RDFS/OWL 语义规则直接映射为 Prolog 规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% RDF 三元组表示&#10;triple(john, type, person).&#10;triple(john, age, 30).&#10;triple(person, subclass_of, living_thing).&#10;triple(knows, type, symmetric_property).&#10;&#10;%% RDFS 推理规则&#10;rdf(S, P, O) :- triple(S, P, O).&#10;rdf(S, type, C) :-&#10;    triple(S, type, C1),&#10;    triple(C1, subclass_of, C).&#10;rdf(S, P, O) :-&#10;    triple(P, type, symmetric_property),&#10;    triple(O, P, S).&#10;&#10;%% 传递闭包&#10;subclass(A, B) :- triple(A, subclass_of, B).&#10;subclass(A, C) :- triple(A, subclass_of, B), subclass(B, C).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% RDF 三元组表示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>triple(john, type, person).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>triple(john, age, 30).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>triple(person, subclass_of, living_thing).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>triple(knows, type, symmetric_property).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% RDFS 推理规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rdf(S, P, O) :- triple(S, P, O).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rdf(S, type, C) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    triple(S, type, C1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    triple(C1, subclass_of, C).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rdf(S, P, O) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    triple(P, type, symmetric_property),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    triple(O, P, S).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 传递闭包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>subclass(A, B) :- triple(A, subclass_of, B).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>subclass(A, C) :- triple(A, subclass_of, B), subclass(B, C).</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SWI-Prolog 的 <code>library(semweb)</code> 提供了完整的 RDF 存储和 SPARQL 查询引擎，支撑了多个工业级语义 Web 应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自然语言处理\">自然语言处理</h2><p>Prolog 的 DCG 机制（详见<a href=\"../programming-techniques/dcg-parsing\">DCG 与语法解析</a>）使其在自然语言处理领域有独特优势：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 语义解析：将自然语言映射到逻辑形式&#10;sentence(S) --&gt; noun_phrase(NP), verb_phrase(VP),&#10;    { S = event(VP, NP) }.&#10;&#10;noun_phrase(entity(Name)) --&gt; proper_noun(Name).&#10;noun_phrase(quant(Det, Noun)) --&gt; determiner(Det), common_noun(Noun).&#10;&#10;verb_phrase(action(Verb, Obj)) --&gt; transitive_verb(Verb), noun_phrase(Obj).&#10;verb_phrase(state(Verb)) --&gt; intransitive_verb(Verb).&#10;&#10;proper_noun(john) --&gt; [john].&#10;common_noun(book) --&gt; [book].&#10;determiner(every) --&gt; [every].&#10;transitive_verb(reads) --&gt; [reads].&#10;&#10;?- phrase(sentence(S), [john, reads, every, book]).&#10;S = event(action(reads, quant(every, book)), entity(john)).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 语义解析：将自然语言映射到逻辑形式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sentence(S) --> noun_phrase(NP), verb_phrase(VP),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { S = event(VP, NP) }.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>noun_phrase(entity(Name)) --> proper_noun(Name).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>noun_phrase(quant(Det, Noun)) --> determiner(Det), common_noun(Noun).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>verb_phrase(action(Verb, Obj)) --> transitive_verb(Verb), noun_phrase(Obj).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>verb_phrase(state(Verb)) --> intransitive_verb(Verb).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proper_noun(john) --> [john].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>common_noun(book) --> [book].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>determiner(every) --> [every].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>transitive_verb(reads) --> [reads].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- phrase(sentence(S), [john, reads, every, book]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>S = event(action(reads, quant(every, book)), entity(john)).</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"规则引擎与业务逻辑\">规则引擎与业务逻辑</h2><p>Prolog 在企业应用中作为规则引擎使用——业务规则用声明式方式维护，独立于应用代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 贷款审批规则&#10;:- module(loan_rules, [eligible/2]).&#10;&#10;eligible(Applicant, Amount) :-&#10;    credit_score(Applicant, Score), Score &gt;= 700,&#10;    income(Applicant, Income), Income &gt;= Amount * 3,&#10;    debt_ratio(Applicant, Ratio), Ratio &lt; 0.4,&#10;    \\+ blacklisted(Applicant).&#10;&#10;%% 利率计算&#10;interest_rate(Applicant, Rate) :-&#10;    credit_score(Applicant, Score),&#10;    score_to_rate(Score, Rate).&#10;&#10;score_to_rate(Score, 0.035) :- Score &gt;= 800.&#10;score_to_rate(Score, 0.045) :- Score &gt;= 700, Score &lt; 800.&#10;score_to_rate(Score, 0.065) :- Score &gt;= 600, Score &lt; 700.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 贷款审批规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- module(loan_rules, [eligible/2]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>eligible(Applicant, Amount) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    credit_score(Applicant, Score), Score >= 700,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    income(Applicant, Income), Income >= Amount * 3,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    debt_ratio(Applicant, Ratio), Ratio &#x3C; 0.4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \\+ blacklisted(Applicant).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 利率计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interest_rate(Applicant, Rate) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    credit_score(Applicant, Score),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    score_to_rate(Score, Rate).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>score_to_rate(Score, 0.035) :- Score >= 800.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>score_to_rate(Score, 0.045) :- Score >= 700, Score &#x3C; 800.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>score_to_rate(Score, 0.065) :- Score >= 600, Score &#x3C; 700.</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用领域</th>\n<th>Prolog 角色</th>\n<th>商业案例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>金融合规</td>\n<td>规则引擎</td>\n<td>反洗钱规则检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置管理</td>\n<td>约束求解</td>\n<td>产品配置器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调度优化</td>\n<td>CLP 求解</td>\n<td>航班/课表调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法律推理</td>\n<td>规范逻辑</td>\n<td>合同条款验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生物信息</td>\n<td>知识库</td>\n<td>基因通路分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"神经符号融合-prolog-与-llm\">神经符号融合：Prolog 与 LLM</h2><p>2024-2026 年的 AI 发展揭示了纯神经方法的局限——LLM 在事实记忆和逻辑推理上的不可靠性催生了神经符号融合方向。Prolog 在其中扮演两个角色：</p>\n<p><strong>角色一：LLM 输出的验证层</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 验证 LLM 生成的查询计划是否合法&#10;validate_plan(Plan) :-&#10;    plan_steps(Plan, Steps),&#10;    maplist(valid_action, Steps),&#10;    causal_chain(Steps),&#10;    \\+ contains_contradiction(Steps).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 验证 LLM 生成的查询计划是否合法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>validate_plan(Plan) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    plan_steps(Plan, Steps),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    maplist(valid_action, Steps),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    causal_chain(Steps),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \\+ contains_contradiction(Steps).</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>角色二：可验证推理的执行引擎</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% LLM 将自然语言转为 Prolog 查询，Prolog 执行符号推理&#10;%% 输入：&quot;所有哺乳动物都是温血的，鲸是哺乳动物，鲸是温血的吗？&quot;&#10;%% LLM 输出：&#10;warm_blooded(X) :- mammal(X).&#10;mammal(whale).&#10;%% Prolog 验证：&#10;?- warm_blooded(whale).&#10;true.  % 可证明的结论，非概率猜测\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% LLM 将自然语言转为 Prolog 查询，Prolog 执行符号推理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 输入：\"所有哺乳动物都是温血的，鲸是哺乳动物，鲸是温血的吗？\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% LLM 输出：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>warm_blooded(X) :- mammal(X).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mammal(whale).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% Prolog 验证：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- warm_blooded(whale).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>true.  % 可证明的结论，非概率猜测</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SWI-Prolog 的 Janus 接口（Python 互操作）使得在同一进程中结合 PyTorch/Transformers 模型与 Prolog 推理成为可能——详见 <a href=\"swi-prolog-ecosystem\">SWI-Prolog 生态</a>中的 Janus 章节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Prolog 的价值在于把「知识」和「推理」都用同一种声明式语言表达，本文要点归纳如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从扁平事实到 IS-A 层次、框架、三元组与本体，表示方法可按结构强度与推理成本选择；</li>\n<li>专家系统的规则库即 Prolog 子句，推理引擎就是 SLD 归结，实现成本极低；</li>\n<li>借助元解释器可精确追踪每一步推理，满足可解释 AI 对决策链的要求；</li>\n<li>语义网推理把 RDFS/OWL 规则直接写成 Prolog 规则，<code>library(semweb)</code> 提供工业级支撑；</li>\n<li>DCG 让自然语言到逻辑形式的语义解析得以声明式表达；</li>\n<li>企业规则引擎、配置管理、调度优化等场景都有成熟实践；</li>\n<li>在 LLM 时代，Prolog 充当输出验证层与可证明推理的执行引擎，是神经符号融合的关键一环。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若要了解支撑这些应用的运行时与库生态，可继续阅读 <a href=\"swi-prolog-ecosystem\">SWI-Prolog 生态</a>；若要对比其他逻辑编程语言在知识推理上的取舍，见<a href=\"modern-logic-programming\">现代逻辑编程语言</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"知识表示与 AI 应用","id":"知识表示与-ai-应用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"知识表示的基本模式","id":"知识表示的基本模式"},{"level":3,"text":"分类层次与继承","id":"分类层次与继承"},{"level":3,"text":"框架表示","id":"框架表示"},{"level":2,"text":"专家系统","id":"专家系统"},{"level":3,"text":"可解释性优势","id":"可解释性优势"},{"level":2,"text":"语义网与本体推理","id":"语义网与本体推理"},{"level":2,"text":"自然语言处理","id":"自然语言处理"},{"level":2,"text":"规则引擎与业务逻辑","id":"规则引擎与业务逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"神经符号融合：Prolog 与 LLM","id":"神经符号融合-prolog-与-llm"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"并发与并行 Prolog","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/advanced-topics/concurrency-parallel-prolog"},"next":{"title":"SWI-Prolog 生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/applications/swi-prolog-ecosystem"}}